{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e579899873fe9d3d73e9223195f23484f07867b24831b63ef5ba4770c28d7ce1",
      "source_sha256": "93a07a3450583b21ef87167752c68db7f459d39f584972b5e4501f64978b6a05",
      "translation": "塞蕾丝汀，请看这个。好像是保存研究记录的装置……其中有一项，叫作“拜泽恩的研究结果”。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:54009f05b5f02ec86afa3dc4b14f9efb47b71f93184399b46df44e87021c4f34",
      "source_sha256": "331bff177b631bf876b587c0440c918bcf1922393d752b1ac2deabb05bf48a08",
      "translation": "研究……？上面写了什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9172f23c8c11d3a2e34229c3dce511c2695d59d2b33fc947b1c2e667c6c5ff75",
      "source_sha256": "23b7ef68e83c1173cf2bc90a4b9a66b108a2e5c13244ce990861f03ce22e9160",
      "translation": "这份报告，是将拥有出色战斗能力的人，用作哨兵材料时的研究结果……难道。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:977d8bc31cbce091f55c2090197736aa8623896fa14c32ff8f944449df08bc27",
      "source_sha256": "3dcf1ca425a1958e31e8cfa1f08fccaef61f799b20d1fedbc243fc085993d3dd",
      "translation": "实验对象，剑士拜泽恩……实验主导者，修亚伦、克蕾尔……是制造哨兵的实验。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:625e1be00df18acfe19ac8af36d821de04d8fed38e47c4ea51089ed5fa7dc8b0",
      "source_sha256": "b031015cbf3e0e06eddc04e6e38546a6d9879b914f9d8daace746ef58750ef18",
      "translation": "可恶……这么说，连塞蕾丝汀的父亲也……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4f3e725aa0cba20f1aa278398c124ba8943de17539d3e7691b54fab9e582f1c0",
      "source_sha256": "5db8d1e8f808d03d3999876c37ba1acbe28f8e4f14a837adbb4f93b822e798a6",
      "translation": "骗人……爸爸……变成哨兵了吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fe84797d520c579879520d37080fa616e64f29ba0790dac0f60c179b53652e68",
      "source_sha256": "0db16d997f327f4a6721f36337d68484e6700fca96c25f8c5bd2ace9fe94de16",
      "translation": "我念一下。哨兵巨大化，并陷入暴走。因此，贝尔福特市区的大部分，遭到了破坏。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1ec827bb531cf6829f3c48990780bfec0cdd1a75ef08f11464a154a0fe75a32d",
      "source_sha256": "86dda28510fe41106a3b549c1949e0db3068256e128bbb1f81606f6c0ff2777e",
      "translation": "虽然无法确定，这是名为拜泽恩的实验体，自身意志所致，还是因为肉体强大，但确认了制造怪物型哨兵的风险。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:82c55ccb669d4fd87c1ab2c3e9b3ad527a92d884323fa82f0a06a73bf33ea7b2",
      "source_sha256": "0d6086d668f242bb1cc143f5ec8819924b65b254485d73b1e219617ecb8b2d4f",
      "translation": "贝尔福特市区遭到破坏后，判定为无法控制，捕获后，移送至鲁哈尔特高原。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1bc3d80f531d4bd1f3fc177816deef1bd091a62406b4de0184fcd66ece779eb4",
      "source_sha256": "0ecce65b29786b52ad4b21ead03f8a851b96ddbc920915700c951673c7a68fe2",
      "translation": "在鲁哈尔特高原处理……塞蕾丝汀……很遗憾。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f569baae203be225e90b7a839f80295dd469179e585b450ba116a2525a0170ca",
      "source_sha256": "3315a2373e3383e48f369f9f5205b5e041fe48c78be3ce78619cc577622fdb1a",
      "translation": "原来，贝尔福特遭到破坏，不只是因为战争。竟然是哨兵实验……这群肮脏的家伙。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1219adb6827ba191b6da418ab3d3c3df519dd0589341cd10e939ba002362df2a",
      "source_sha256": "a8685d7f9d44dab3fb253da00c0dc5ae913ab8462a3818543a6aecd4605f8e45",
      "translation": "啊……原来如此……爸爸已经不在了啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d37b2da18c48bbc7d70cb860a732e40741e438c0ed8882a2b537c7c1c39bbd1b",
      "source_sha256": "19d3c19c9c6435f48892c793737972dd77b098a20c728de086443c5feec26773",
      "translation": "塞蕾丝汀……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:048ce161404f1d4cd22955a799ea5f897b9906d5f0300e148ff38f7210d9942c",
      "source_sha256": "98d4864223e09a00062bdb64df54bb58f719897dfe9972b85f0fd73e30ac81c1",
      "translation": "他已经死了……所以，才没有来看我。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:616fffad6e0eebcc2cb9aa33413ee2d1e878ed33af43a3d28deca909e81bbbfa",
      "source_sha256": "1f4406f27fb4664fa5c398e90213e3ef5493cce228c3183ac9b04772fa6a0371",
      "translation": "不然，他一定至少会回柯塔马雷，看我一次的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4d781049cf60225e1e54dcf4e65e4a6698bdf0508bfc091245086f3b87ebf0af",
      "source_sha256": "5c5c6b0a846f9a64ab9aa18027b7d2a08274662fae413616d10504aaf85fd130",
      "translation": "也得告诉族长……父亲已经不在了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2d28eafc417ebafac47cd0bc15fcca5969a72ce412d7e922d457d7aab8c4b156",
      "source_sha256": "43550801a0bfc5218292ad060896919d0798edffb3549a0cf9d4efbc2863b790",
      "translation": "塞蕾丝汀。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f00b01f4761f7704d2d95ee86a4b2b7652951a0f1f5e6cc356b3373e86a980d4",
      "source_sha256": "f4ec9440c424c3445bc544e31735e393979f088d3ab35008d0ed06b6f16ae4e1",
      "translation": "这种时候，可以哭的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:aaaa672d2727facf07c3451007af245988e11b87ad4a98a3b3a5d51c4c80a6be",
      "source_sha256": "83037d37650744651ca162aea8ab578f30b64def0d53bb56dac7f1f27af07128",
      "translation": "呜……阿尔戈哥哥……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4e60362c4da50b9b222495ce58e26ae0f16d62308af9fb93fb21e3cb2ff52c19",
      "source_sha256": "d31733b6ff547d8be730083a4d24a473bc02c3365a0944de387cca82cde518bd",
      "translation": "呜……呜……呜哇啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5498bcbc81682f33434a045ef864f972984b498a866dcca574bfdeff21bd828b",
      "source_sha256": "61860f5665232108b41b313389f5c68e76420c2dcfa5531ba685b528a4c9c100",
      "translation": "去鲁哈尔特，找拜泽恩吧。至少，也该给他立座坟。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e9b6d0d6e781b6e8ee539a432ea9aeb7d033ab12433f1f3121e77e2a0eeec34f",
      "source_sha256": "c660e095eb9d79e4d028d781be826f0d0a590f846d3c42a9bc8a5ff86e750da5",
      "translation": "谢谢你，哥哥……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2d17bf52fa9a10ce8cb58904bc27f47c6ad9c4477e8a1a117378ec553fa27593",
      "source_sha256": "f9323629317a558bf5e5083f679c0ee88df5e8addd112fb4be2d76e928b71132",
      "translation": "应该先找和这件事有关的人。因为，我们得先弄清楚，他在鲁哈尔特高原的确切位置。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6ce3d4121f6a5595792a496273a16e0448b94ecfddb6bfed853c302c0a823b27",
      "source_sha256": "aec46e8e08e3a137cb6579cf9a7531e1b80e2398f10a5c94a03ed36e7eed9a99",
      "translation": "参与实验的家伙……总不能跑去问克蕾尔，或是修亚伦吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:69b565c0e5c58d550a3b3303f01878449b1ee58988f65d5e4c8fbc6b758d79c5",
      "source_sha256": "f355e8abc3625e00a3b32c5d10d8684a9d860589dc734089b2c310b33be4202d",
      "translation": "那就从现在开始打听。就这样，只靠我们自己，是没法在鲁哈尔特高原找到拜泽恩的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fa3fdf1c2f210a9d1784783631d857566b7d5956f65eea74a9025eaabb659201",
      "source_sha256": "b8f5acf1fbae137e3262d504c5e561f8af9da1116d20f5d127992e7061849a32",
      "translation": "毕竟，他应该已经成了哨兵的模样……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dd7b18e2b590bffff3f0e8405c8615ba62b91c81ea491250691ad032e3fab9ae",
      "source_sha256": "dd3fe8d35d2dab1ee071a3b98d0fa6c3a071a48d4a2e5edde446fcceeb53a809",
      "translation": "是的，拜泽恩……我知道。他被带进研究所，是为了进行制造更强大哨兵的实验。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1e145f870db4c8488d7b727e2be864a09425d47d49b67aff317feacdcdc49d5c",
      "source_sha256": "7d186ac10bb46ade99e2f86e2a05626315e88d2e86d4e3c0ebd3c673647950a3",
      "translation": "我虽然没有参加那个实验，但据我所知，情况相当惨烈。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:39820fa6b5dfb73bc34161e71dbb4f298b72aadec6eae10c0480ada6831581f4",
      "source_sha256": "319e2c047f04e825f6f378e20a859c052699fc859df725438102be022065736e",
      "translation": "不过，据我所知，拜泽恩这个人，已经……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a52e1969451d48ef2601888a8c0a92ce77926af510454a7d99622754e94ff304",
      "source_sha256": "3ecb1f04d676b01758a564eb34c0c47f8049eb41b0b0c38f3af55f7979fbf6f2",
      "translation": "对不起……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4815da558efc26315abcffed509cf3449f460277c6fb8b4483abf8f30f738446",
      "source_sha256": "bde56fa3584c589a3255723d89f671461442c0752c2b22a5a28c7eade32de330",
      "translation": "……去鲁哈尔特高原的话，那里有一片石灰丘陵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:716a504ae5e9d549696ef8fba4cf93a89d0d1820a7e5c5ffd05206be98ab20f0",
      "source_sha256": "078ec92683ce0af11e9e55ab0ddd2f2d1a05274d1c43bc9fa3c52ea500f67f6a",
      "translation": "那些，全都是被丢弃的哨兵残骸。废弃的哨兵，会变成石灰块。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0e4183505e56e2cee513eee9ca04dfbbbf7fd05abc5df0bd56855b680e566435",
      "source_sha256": "bd96cf96336c4d87d3c5d48a163ed53f77915009d32a26af321ed3f13b5ecccd",
      "translation": "去那里，应该就能找到。如果找到那块最大的残骸……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:52d30ee31936841154689990f823bb1153db6926d5032599891aa723f1ef1b8c",
      "source_sha256": "d5328ef670a869388272e69f75534c23e8fcbe29ee94296df0a2641eacc0a51c",
      "translation": "鲁哈尔特也有北部军聚集。请小心。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9c5aea23d1eaa55cf05dc4a6dc0e36602427e02ca07d55e42d304c705b9b362a",
      "source_sha256": "a8c502e80f78d2214cf4bedf2de2f41f8a384541994d480a44ce0aa715735e92",
      "translation": "要放弃吗？也是，那不过是些石灰块罢了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8a93f69d337916348907a82b2fe83ef22c5d9d18dbd679d04e6e5c48f4c148d5",
      "source_sha256": "3a862aaca793d380e93709115758234d45bd17b37bf9ef833d8a2c4f24187814",
      "translation": "鲁哈尔特高原的一角，有一片用于丢弃哨兵的石灰丘陵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:58fb5c5973d4b0d59e9110b129f769753f943c6ae54e9d1b4f1c08848426544f",
      "source_sha256": "7be52a94124f579f88474401e29f86baa0ec90c73543d7191ddd548e5b109457",
      "translation": "请在鲁哈尔特高原寻找石灰丘陵"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be253244de960c7f475c953bf824dfe2881884dcedb6c7ef7f24c24033952cf5",
      "source_sha256": "3a983b570a62203462f29e93ee2e49f31347f09c17b9222150673b26119c3676",
      "translation": "拜泽恩之墓"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1890ebce3baa279d423044e1131e2f620b649c25f4fc0d6b5e6d0e7caea3e0e3",
      "source_sha256": "bb1fb5211f9e22e9e2916b4c348c1a8b1872b1d32cb3d7ce819ca2376748e20c",
      "translation": "既然已经拿到漩涡炸弹，就得快点去城墙附近。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c319a70aa7b55ed2c75414568877cdfcc7a3e185f2f93b035173865e42b6ca07",
      "source_sha256": "22b30df8edb4ffc2ee90caddb6d0356beaeeab4af8f869d145ea789434150331",
      "translation": "用漩涡炸弹破坏石像，寻找泽罗哈说的秘密通道吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7bdb8829716ac5ebbcc67669f29f65b0d5ee11cf32dfde908bdd3182b7833569",
      "source_sha256": "7f75ef5fef8b981f24222cce0e71e111f9296986d3cc66d54800711e7c2807cd",
      "translation": "既然已经找到秘密通道，就进入哨兵研究所吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:eb21d0a1431953b21f0da68ea28ed7646e190cd58397c78eecbf53262ed92693",
      "source_sha256": "8c518d354f46fa0691ec03eab0f8dce3b76877643983f44738d2498d18e49445",
      "translation": "洁菲，我一定会救出你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5ba56bf3b416c9df5f72fda0d35ac8249a8b032189759a4d326e056dddc086bd",
      "source_sha256": "5a8ff8d219c6136f362f61812b2ebe2d6cbbb8261fb6240019757ea903e94dbc",
      "translation": "去城墙前吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:865b8dadbbc3a05ef7fa60b03894a781ad783e672929d5c5484bcd733d7b9fb1",
      "source_sha256": "0f9e75872434c244c3de8998051b470099d97f4fb04a270cfb1dd0f6c351cf76",
      "translation": "用漩涡炸弹，破坏石像吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f5d32abf8d64dd7b0cfb3325d1ee94e31c0467520fae29b8e31eba3e6a833a79",
      "source_sha256": "79510a4d1b35ecd696d47aff02165b48aa942403d73d8b53c15a4d58a1574d6e",
      "translation": "进入哨兵研究所吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:62740a627f0b7d96a73b66ddc8701505befee101b7dfc2d6d511004b9fb1b308",
      "source_sha256": "ea09ba34fed2157fd82941a2b832769ebd46b6da6f856309adf5504eaf5c22b6",
      "translation": "在露回来之前，先休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2f9d80bd0f7953e36df6618a603d889f408782619e80ec28c87b300c5e2a772b",
      "source_sha256": "0c2c22b77a6928f45e571fe3a3752c42894f4411fa6c0740a25290de087eb49c",
      "translation": "泽罗哈说的贝尔福特城墙，就在西北方。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4d055ca83edf3837ac6ca5153418f2eab3e7b5bb3851e7e26a6dd5e74bada282",
      "source_sha256": "a4306c19902ecb213470989c99645a8eee13bd17241588d8b057af4c242e39c7",
      "translation": "既然没法用火破坏石像，就只能借助风的力量了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:65a4ad52c961471c2dc7c35f1fbc77bcd11c9af6345b758b68814037343575a5",
